    81	\begin{proof}
    82	The ``if'' part of the above reduction also holds for the game of Set: if $G'$ has a multidimensional perfect matching it also has a Set. For the ``only if'' part, notice that if $G'$ has a Set then this Set is also a multidimensional perfect matching since no vertex-multiedge can pass through a value that belongs to another vertex-multiedge. \qed
    83	\end{proof}
